bowe-v-scott/#664\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Bowe v. Scott\">233 U. S. 658, 664</a></span>; and see <em>El Paso Sash &amp; Door Co.. </em>v. <em>Carraway, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"8143383\"><a href=\"/opinion/8181464/el-paso-sash-door-co-v-carraway/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: El Paso Sash &amp; Door Co. v. Carraway\">245 U. S. 643</a></span>. <em>Mr. Robert H. Elder </em>for plaintiffs in error. <em>Mr. William P. B\u00farr </em>and <em>Mr. John F. O\u2019Brien </em>for defendant in error, submitted.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}